-- WI-754: three independent query patterns for `--query-file` — a resolvable one,
-- an UNKNOWN functor, then another resolvable one. The middle unknown must not
-- abort the run: each pattern is independent, so the THIRD still runs, and the
-- process exits non-zero because one pattern named no known functor. Queried
-- against props.anthill (base/holds are defined there; nonesuch is not).
fact base(1)
fact nonesuch(1)
fact holds
